{"seq":2,"slug":"key-milestone-highlight","title":"关键节点高亮与状态语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-tracking-experience/tracking-timeline/key-milestone-highlight","wordCount":2622,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"关键节点高亮与状态语义\">关键节点高亮与状态语义</h1><p>一条完整的跨境轨迹会有 15 到 25 个节点。买家不会读 25 行，他会扫一眼找三件他想知道的事：发货了没有、到哪了、还有多久。所以时间线的第一性设计问题不是「怎么把 25 个节点排好看」，而是「哪 3 到 5 个节点值得被放大到一眼可见」。</p>\n<p>这决定了本节的立场：<strong>时间线是两层结构，不是一层</strong>。底层是完整的节点流（<a href=\"unified-timeline-localize\">统一节点时间线与多语言文案</a> 产出的枚举），上层是从中抽取出来的里程碑（milestone）。里程碑不是「重要的节点」这种模糊说法，而是一个有明确定义的集合，并且这个定义要在客户端和服务端之间对齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-里程碑判定与四个准入条件\">核心概念：里程碑判定与四个准入条件</h2><p>一个节点能不能进里程碑集合，取决于四个都可以客观检查的条件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>反例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>状态跃迁</strong></td>\n<td>它标志着包裹的物理归属或位置发生了质变，而非量的积累</td>\n<td>「在分拣中心 A 扫描」→「在分拣中心 B 扫描」不是跃迁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>用户可行动</strong></td>\n<td>到达它之后，用户可能需要做点什么或至少需要知道</td>\n<td>「已到目的国」意味着可能要准备收货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>不可逆</strong></td>\n<td>它一旦发生就基本不会撤销</td>\n<td>「派送中」可撤销（派送失败），「已揽收」不可撤销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>跨线路普遍</strong></td>\n<td>绝大多数线路都会经过它</td>\n<td>「转运至邻国分拨」只在少数多跳线路出现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四个条件同时满足才算里程碑。按其结果，一个典型 hub 的里程碑集合是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"PICKED_UP               已揽收        ← 确定性开始&#10;DEPARTED_ORIGIN         已离开始发国   ← 用户感知到&quot;出发了&quot;&#10;ARRIVED_DESTINATION     已到达目的国   ← 心理转折点&#10;CUSTOMS_CLEARANCE_START 正在清关       ← 最不可控的一段&#10;OUT_FOR_DELIVERY        派送中        ← 用户回到页面最频繁的时刻&#10;DELIVERED               已投递        ← 结束&#10;DELIVERY_EXCEPTION      派送异常      ← 唯一的负向里程碑\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>PICKED_UP               已揽收        ← 确定性开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DEPARTED_ORIGIN         已离开始发国   ← 用户感知到\"出发了\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ARRIVED_DESTINATION     已到达目的国   ← 心理转折点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CUSTOMS_CLEARANCE_START 正在清关       ← 最不可控的一段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>OUT_FOR_DELIVERY        派送中        ← 用户回到页面最频繁的时刻</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DELIVERED               已投递        ← 结束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DELIVERY_EXCEPTION      派送异常      ← 唯一的负向里程碑</span></span></code></pre></div><p>七项。注意 <code>CUSTOMS_CLEARANCE_END</code> 不在列表里——「清关完成」不可行动（用户无需做什么），且它的信息量已经被「到达目的国 → 派送中」的推进覆盖。把它做成里程碑只会让进度条多一格，不增加任何理解。<strong>里程碑集合宁少勿多，因为每多一项，进度条的语义就被稀释一分。</strong></p>\n<p>反过来，<code>DELIVERY_EXCEPTION</code> 是唯一的负向里程碑，这不是对称设计的美学选择，而是因为它是唯一一个「用户必须知道，否则会产生更坏后果」的负向事件。包裹被退回了而用户不知道，比包裹延误三天而用户不知道严重得多。</p>\n<p>把节点流和里程碑的关系画出来，会看到这是一次有损压缩，而压缩的位置正是设计决定：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[完整节点流 15-25 项] --&gt; B{四条件判定}&#10;    B --&gt;|状态跃迁 + 可行动&lt;br/&gt;+ 不可逆 + 跨线路| C[里程碑集合 5-8 项]&#10;    B --&gt;|否则| D[折叠进相邻里程碑的&lt;br/&gt;次要事件列表]&#10;    C --&gt; E[进度条 / 步骤条]&#10;    C --&gt; F[推送触发点]&#10;    D --&gt; G[展开后的完整时间线]&#10;    E --&gt; H[一眼可读的概览]&#10;    G --&gt; I[想深究时的细节]\">graph TD\n    A[完整节点流 15-25 项] --&gt; B{四条件判定}\n    B --&gt;|状态跃迁 + 可行动&lt;br/&gt;+ 不可逆 + 跨线路| C[里程碑集合 5-8 项]\n    B --&gt;|否则| D[折叠进相邻里程碑的&lt;br/&gt;次要事件列表]\n    C --&gt; E[进度条 / 步骤条]\n    C --&gt; F[推送触发点]\n    D --&gt; G[展开后的完整时间线]\n    E --&gt; H[一眼可读的概览]\n    G --&gt; I[想深究时的细节]</pre><p><code>F</code> 那条边是本 hub 第三章的直接输入：<strong>推送触发点就是里程碑集合</strong>。如果推送事件口径和里程碑口径不一致（比如推送在某个非里程碑节点上也发），用户点进来会看到一个推送里提到、但主界面上被折叠起来的节点，产生「我刚才看到的那个去哪了」的困惑。所以两者必须共用同一个判定，这个判定应该由服务端产出而不是客户端各算一遍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"进度条-把离散里程碑映射到连续位置\">进度条：把离散里程碑映射到连续位置</h2><p>里程碑集合有了，但一个七项的集合如果渲染成七个小圆点，用户仍然要数。进度条要回答的是「大概到哪了」，所以需要一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 上的连续量。</p>\n<p>朴素做法是按里程碑序号线性映射：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = \\frac{i}{n-1}, \\quad i \\in \\{0, 1, \\ldots, n-1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1059em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3365em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 是当前已达成的最新里程碑序号，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是里程碑总数。七项时，<code>PICKED_UP</code> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>、<code>DELIVERED</code> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、中间的等距分布。</p>\n<p><strong>这个线性映射是错的，因为它在时间上是高度非均匀的。</strong> 一条典型的中美跨境线路，「已揽收 → 已离开始发国」可能只花 8 小时，「已离开始发国 → 已到达目的国」可能花 6 天，「正在清关」可能花 1 到 5 天且方差极大，「派送中 → 已投递」只花几个小时。等距映射会让用户在包裹刚发货时看到进度条一下子跳到 1/6，然后六天一动不动——进度条传递的信息是「卡住了」，而实际上一切正常。</p>\n<p>一个更好的映射是按<strong>历史中位耗时</strong>归一化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = \\frac{\\sum_{j&lt;i} \\bar{t}_j}{\\sum_{j=1}^{n-1} \\bar{t}_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8575em;vertical-align:-1.2798em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5777em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.156em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8258em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{t}_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.038em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是从里程碑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 到里程碑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的历史中位耗时。这样进度条推进的速度大致与该段是否「花时间」成正比，视觉上更符合真实感。</p>\n<p>但这带来一个必须正视的副作用：<strong>进度条会在干线段上长时间不动，而这在用户眼里和「卡住」无法区分。</strong> 这正是需要额外信号的地方——进度条本身不该独自承担「一切正常」的表达，它应该配合一句说明，例如「干线运输中，预计 3 天后到达目的国」。这句话的数据来源是 <a href=\"../eta-visibility/eta-display-range\">预计送达区间展示与更新</a>。</p>\n<p>对于「当前处于哪一段」的判定，还有一个边界情况：<strong>如果回退事件发生</strong>（例如 <code>OUT_FOR_DELIVERY</code> 之后出现 <code>DELIVERY_EXCEPTION</code>），进度条该退回去吗？答案是<strong>不退回，而是叠加一个异常态</strong>。进度条退回会摧毁「事情在推进」这个基础信任，而实际上包裹并没有回到发货前的状态。正确的做法是：进度条停在该里程碑，同时显示一个异常标记与说明文案。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Milestone =&#10;  | &#39;PICKED_UP&#39;&#10;  | &#39;DEPARTED_ORIGIN&#39;&#10;  | &#39;ARRIVED_DESTINATION&#39;&#10;  | &#39;CUSTOMS_CLEARANCE_START&#39;&#10;  | &#39;OUT_FOR_DELIVERY&#39;&#10;  | &#39;DELIVERED&#39;&#10;  | &#39;DELIVERY_EXCEPTION&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface MilestoneWeights {&#10;  readonly medianHours: Readonly&lt;Record&lt;Exclude&lt;Milestone, &#39;PICKED_UP&#39;&gt;, number&gt;&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const ORDER: readonly Milestone[] = [&#10;  &#39;PICKED_UP&#39;,&#10;  &#39;DEPARTED_ORIGIN&#39;,&#10;  &#39;ARRIVED_DESTINATION&#39;,&#10;  &#39;CUSTOMS_CLEARANCE_START&#39;,&#10;  &#39;OUT_FOR_DELIVERY&#39;,&#10;  &#39;DELIVERED&#39;,&#10;];&#10;&#10;export function progressOf(current: Milestone, weights: MilestoneWeights): number {&#10;  if (current === &#39;DELIVERY_EXCEPTION&#39;) return Number.NaN;&#10;  const idx = ORDER.indexOf(current);&#10;  if (idx &lt;= 0) return 0;&#10;  let elapsed = 0;&#10;  let total = 0;&#10;  for (let j = 1; j &lt; ORDER.length; j += 1) {&#10;    const h = weights.medianHours[ORDER[j] as Exclude&lt;Milestone, &#39;PICKED_UP&#39;&gt;];&#10;    total += h;&#10;    if (j &lt;= idx) elapsed += h;&#10;  }&#10;  return elapsed / total;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Milestone</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PICKED_UP'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DEPARTED_ORIGIN'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ARRIVED_DESTINATION'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CUSTOMS_CLEARANCE_START'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OUT_FOR_DELIVERY'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DELIVERED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DELIVERY_EXCEPTION'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MilestoneWeights</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki